==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|آج|tr=aç||hungry}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-oat|tr=aç|||hungry}}, from {{der|tr|otk|𐰀𐰲|tr=āč||hungry}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*āç}}, {{m|trk-pro|*ạ̄č||hunger}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|otk|𐰀𐰲|tr=āç|gloss=hungry}}, {{cog|oui||tr=aç|gloss=hungry}}, {{cog|xqa||tr=āç|gloss=hungry}}, {{cog|az|ac||hungry}}, {{cog|ba|ас||hungry}}, {{cog|cv|выҫӑ||hunger, hungry}}, {{cog|kk|аш||hunger}}, {{cog|kjh|ас||hunger, hungry}}, {{cog|qwm||tr=aç|gloss=hungry|sc=Arab}}, {{cog|ky|ач||hungry}}, {{cog|alt|ач||hunger}}, {{cog|tk|aç|āç|gloss=hungry}}, {{cog|tyv|аш||hunger, hungry}}, {{cog|ug|ئاچ||hungry}}, {{cog|uz|och||hungry}}, {{cog|sah|аас||hunger}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ɑtʃ]|lang=tr}}

===Noun===
{{tr-noun|ı|lar}}

# {{lb|tr|archaic}} [[hunger]]
#: {{ux|tr|'''''Acımdan''' ölüyorum.''|I am dying '''of hunger'''.|inline=1}} {{gloss|Literally '''of my hunger'''}}
# [[hungry]], [[esurient]] or [[greedy]] person or people
#: {{ux|tr|'''''Aç''' ne yemez tok ne demez.''|'''Hungry person''' eats anything, satieted person complains of everything.|inline=1}} {{gloss|A proverb}}

====Usage notes====
*The noun has two declension forms. One normal and one with /ç/→/c/.

